<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets $500 million FRN due 2004, call.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets $500 million FRN due 2004, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP LP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **  .FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.84     FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.84</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE FROM 10.FEB.2000 AT PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
